  { q: 'Is Tarangire worth visiting over the Serengeti?', a: 'Tarangire should not replace the Serengeti on a Tanzania itinerary — it complements it. The two parks offer completely different landscapes and experiences. Tarangire is particularly recommended for elephant enthusiasts, baobab tree photography and visitors who want a less crowded park experience. Adding 1 to 2 nights in Tarangire at the start or end of a Serengeti-Ngorongoro circuit adds significant value.' },
